  "term": "ASD",
  "definition": "ASD stands for autism spectrum disorder, a neurodevelopmental disorder that begins in early childhood. It involves varying levels of difficulty with social interaction, along with restricted interests and repetitive or stereotyped behaviors, and its severity can differ greatly from one child to another.",
